Under UAE Labour Law, employees are entitled to end of service gratuities (severance pay).

UAE Gratuity Calculator has been developed in accordance with UAE Labour Law to allow you to calculate gratuity for limited and unlimited contracts with end of service options.

It is important to calculate your end of service gratuities to ensure you are paid the correct amount due.

UAE Gratuity Calculator will help you to:
 - Financially plan your future;
 - Identify any errors made by your company;
 - Calculate gratuity for limited and unlimited contracts;
 - Understand the gratuity calculation process.

You need to measure your car acceleration or you simply want an utility which will attend you during your travel? iDashboard will be the perfect app for these purposes!
Using the GPS it will let you know the effective speed both in mph or in km/h and the altitude at the same time. You will also be able to measure the 0-60 and 0-100 acceleration both in mph or km/h, you will just have to stop the car, press the test button and start accelerating, the app will start the timer once the car will move.
The HUD mode will help you read the display in low light conditions, such as at night. After you enable it, you will have to place the device below the windscreen on the dashboard, the app will reflect the display on the glass.

Features:
- Measure the car acceleration 0-60 and 0-100;
- Effective GPS speed;
- Night HUD mode;
- Realtime altitude;
- MPH or KM/H;

Ever needed to start a chat on WhatsApp with a number you don't intend adding to your contacts? Enters Launcher for WhatsApp.

- Send chat messages to phone numbers you don't have in your Contacts;
- The most lightweight WhatsApp launcher in the App Store;
- Zero ads, for the best user experience possible;
- As-you-type phone number formatting;
- Infers the country code based on your phone's locale, so you don't have to type it.
- Built with privacy in mind: this app collects absolutely no data from you, the numbers entered, nor your phone. Not even for analytics purposes.

We will never display any ads in this app, ever. We will never offer in-app purchases either.
